\"><span class=\"docx-DefaultParagraphFont-000004\">five</span></ins><del class=\"rev-del docx-000005\" data-author=\"Compare\" data-date=\"2000-01-01T00:00:00Z\"><span class=\"docx-DefaultParagraphFont-000006\">three</span></del><span xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"docx-DefaultParagraphFont-000001\"> rounds of revisions</span><ins class=\"rev-ins docx-000003\" data-author=\"Compare\" data-date=\"2000-01-01T00:00:00Z\"><span class=\"docx-DefaultParagraphFont-000004\"> and delivery of the final source files</span></ins><span class=\"docx-DefaultParagraphFont-000001\">.</span></p><h1 dir=\"ltr\" class=\"docx-Heading1\"><span class=\"docx-DefaultParagraphFont-000002\">2. Project fees and payment</span></h1><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"docx-Normal\"><span xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"docx-DefaultParagraphFont-000001\">The total project fee is USD </span><ins class=\"rev-ins docx-000003\" data-author=\"Compare\" data-date=\"2000-01-01T00:00:00Z\"><span class=\"docx-DefaultParagraphFont-000007\">36,000</span></ins><del class=\"rev-del docx-000005\" data-author=\"Compare\" data-date=\"2000-01-01T00:00:00Z\"><span class=\"docx-DefaultParagraphFont-000008\">30,000</span></del><span class=\"docx-DefaultParagraphFont-000001\">.</span></p><div align=\"left\"><table dir=\"ltr\" class=\"docx-000009\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 216pt;\" /><col style=\"width: 216pt;\" /></colgroup><tr><td class=\"docx-000010\"><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"docx-Normal-000011\"><span class=\"docx-DefaultParagraphFont-000012\">Payment stage</span></p></td><td class=\"docx-000010\"><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"docx-Normal-000011\"><span class=\"docx-DefaultParagraphFont-000012\">Payment share</span></p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"docx-000013\"><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"docx-Normal-000011\"><span class=\"docx-DefaultParagraphFont-000012\">On signing</span></p></td><td class=\"docx-000013\"><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"docx-Normal-000011\"><span class=\"docx-DefaultParagraphFont-000014\">50%</span></p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"docx-000013\"><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"docx-Normal-000011\"><span class=\"docx-DefaultParagraphFont-000012\">On project acceptance</span></p></td><td class=\"docx-000013\"><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"docx-Normal-000011\"><span class=\"docx-DefaultParagraphFont-000014\">50%</span></p></td></tr><tr class=\"rev-row-ins\" data-author=\"Compare\" data-date=\"2000-01-01T00:00:00Z\"><td class=\"docx-000015\"><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"rev-para-ins docx-Normal-000011\" data-author=\"Compare\" data-date=\"2000-01-01T00:00:00Z\"><ins class=\"rev-ins\" data-author=\"Compare\" data-date=\"2000-01-01T00:00:00Z\"><span class=\"docx-DefaultParagraphFont-000012\">Additional requests</span></ins></p></td><td class=\"docx-000015\"><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"rev-para-ins docx-Normal-000011\" data-author=\"Compare\" data-date=\"2000-01-01T00:00:00Z\"><ins class=\"rev-ins\" data-author=\"Compare\" data-date=\"2000-01-01T00:00:00Z\"><span class=\"docx-DefaultParagraphFont-000012\">Subject to separate written agreement</span></ins></p></td></tr></table></div><h1 dir=\"ltr\" class=\"docx-Heading1\"><span class=\"docx-DefaultParagraphFont-000002\">3. Delivery and acceptance</span></h1><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"docx-Normal-000016\"><span class=\"rev-format-change docx-000017\" title=\"Bold added, Font size changed, Font changed\" data-author=\"Compare\" data-date=\"2000-01-01T00:00:00Z\"><span class=\"docx-DefaultParagraphFont-000018\">The Designer will deliver all work within 20 business days of the agreement taking effect.</span></span></p><h1 dir=\"ltr\" class=\"rev-para-ins docx-Heading1\" data-author=\"Compare\" data-date=\"2000-01-01T00:00:00Z\"><ins class=\"rev-ins docx-000003\" data-author=\"Compare\" data-date=\"2000-01-01T00:00:00Z\"><span class=\"docx-DefaultParagraphFont-000019\">4. Intellectual property</span></ins></h1><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"docx-Normal\"><ins class=\"rev-ins docx-000003\" data-author=\"Compare\" data-date=\"2000-01-01T00:00:00Z\"><span class=\"docx-DefaultParagraphFont-000004\">After full payment, the Client receives the agreed usage rights to the final designs.</span></ins><del class=\"rev-del docx-000005\" data-author=\"Compare\" data-date=\"2000-01-01T00:00:00Z\"><span class=\"docx-DefaultParagraphFont-000006\">All communication will take place by email.</span></del></p></div></body></html>","revisions":[{"revisionType":"Inserted","text":"five","author":"Compare","date":"2000-01-01T00:00:00Z"},{"revisionType":"Deleted","text":"three","author":"Compare","date":"2000-01-01T00:00:00Z"},{"revisionType":"Inserted","text":" and delivery of the final source files","author":"Compare","date":"2000-01-01T00:00:00Z"},{"revisionType":"Inserted","text":"36,000","author":"Compare","date":"2000-01-01T00:00:00Z"},{"revisionType":"Deleted","text":"30,000","author":"Compare","date":"2000-01-01T00:00:00Z"},{"revisionType":"Inserted","text":"Additional requests\nSubject to separate written agreement\n","author":"Compare","date":"2000-01-01T00:00:00Z"},{"revisionType":"Inserted","text":"4. Intellectual property\nAfter full payment, the Client receives the agreed usage rights to the final designs.","author":"Compare","date":"2000-01-01T00:00:00Z"},{"revisionType":"Deleted","text":"All communication will take place by email.","author":"Compare","date":"2000-01-01T00:00:00Z"},{"revisionType":"FormatChanged","text":"The Designer will deliver all work within 20 business days of the agreement taking effect.","author":"Compare","date":"2000-01-01T00:00:00Z","formatChange":{"oldProperties":{},"newProperties":{"bold":"<w:b p1:Unid=\"444f32bbde9348b08004852773cd8175\" xmlns:p1=\"http://powertools.codeplex.com/2011\" xmlns:w=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\" />","fontSize":"24"},"changedPropertyNames":["bold","fontSize"]}}],"sources":["921bdd09959cb4786fa4f0fcd42f3b1e630d39e0a81d6b83bb21756978122a34","8a6d35f059ce14df102e401ce4b36489a79f07708ea3c10ba2ced7ef7c3383de"]}